   "widgets_values": [
    "BERTH YIELD / RESUME - render, describe, render again\n\nA first image is rendered, Berth Yield frees ComfyUI's models and lends the card, a vision LLM describes the image and rewrites it as a new prompt, Berth Resume takes the card back, and the second render follows that prompt. Run `berth why comfyui` afterwards to see the yield."
